ight now. You get one small habit to try tonight, from the character in charge.</p>\n      <div class=\"ask-host\"><div data-char=\"toci\"><svg class=\"ch ch-toci \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M60 104C22 80 12 48 34 34c12-7 22 0 26 10 4-10 14-17 26-10 22 14 12 46-26 70z\" fill=\"#FFC6D3\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"58\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"58\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"59\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"59\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M50 74q10 9 20 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M22 66q-10 6-6 16M98 66q10 6 6 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><p>Toci hosts the chat and brings in the right crew member.</p></div>\n      <ul class=\"ask-points\">\n        <li><b>1</b>Pick a topic or type it your way</li>\n        <li><b>2</b>Answer 2 quick questions</li>\n        <li><b>3</b>Get one habit for tonight</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"fine\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Habits only. If you type something serious, like pain, injury or not eating, it will tell you to call your pediatrician instead.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"chat\" aria-label=\"Ask the crew chat\">\n      <div class=\"chat-head\"><div data-char=\"toci\"><svg class=\"ch ch-toci \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M60 104C22 80 12 48 34 34c12-7 22 0 26 10 4-10 14-17 26-10 22 14 12 46-26 70z\" fill=\"#FFC6D3\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"58\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"58\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"59\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"59\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M50 74q10 9 20 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M22 66q-10 6-6 16M98 66q10 6 6 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><div>Toci<small>usually answers in a second</small></div></div>\n      <div class=\"chat-log\" id=\"chat-log\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      <form class=\"chat-form\" id=\"chat-form\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        <label class=\"sr\" for=\"chat-in\">Type your question</label>\n        <input id=\"chat-in\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"Or type it in your own words…\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-foot\" id=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Little Brain Crew home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/assets/brand/lbc-logo-horizontal-white.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"48\"></a>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:340px\">The crew inside your kid’s brain, made simple. <span class=\"draft\">company name · email</span></p>\n      <a href=\"/support\" class=\"support-link\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">♥</span> Support the crew</a>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/#plans\">Plans</a><a href=\"/pricing\">The 30-Day Rese